  "claim": "The birthdate of this former NASA astronaut and a retired captain in the United States Navy, who published the book Lost Moon:  The Perilous Voyage of Apollo 13 was March 25, 1928.",
  "evidencia": "Page: Lost Moon. Sentence: Lost Moon: The Perilous Voyage of Apollo 13 (published in paperback as Apollo 13), is a non-fiction book first published in 1994 by astronaut James Lovell and journalist Jeffrey Kluger, about the failed April 1970 Apollo 13 lunar landing mission which Lovell commanded.\nPage: Jim Lovell. Sentence: James Arthur Lovell Jr. (born March 25, 1928) is a former NASA astronaut and a retired captain in the United States Navy, most famous as the commander of the Apollo 13 mission, which suffered a critical failure en route to the Moon but was brought back safely to Earth by the efforts of the crew and mission control.",
